window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A famous mystery writer drowns in a hotel bathtub. Was it an accident, or foul play? His ghost thinks it was murder. His mystery writer colleagues want to help Mary solve the case. </p> <p>Gary Copper is still on the loose, and gunning for both Bradley and Mary. And, in between all the murder and mayhem, Mary and Bradley are desperately trying to walk up the aisle. Will they ever become husband and wife? </p>"; 
